ll_authoritative_transcript_reviewed":true,"navigation_sources_used_as_gold_evidence":false},"span_registry":[{"end_time":89.19,"quote_text":"那么在re的方案中会做以下几件事，首先是trking把代码库切成一个个小块，一个函数作为一个块，或者一个类为一个块，像这里的三个函数就会被切割成三块，接着是embedding和indexing，将每个块压缩成一串数字坐标。语义越接近，坐标就会越接近。比如说authentication和login就会非常接近。同时还会提取关键字一起放到数据库里。最后是retrieval。当用户询问问题的时候，就把问题转化成数字坐标也提取关键字出来，和数据库里的快做比较，找出最接近的快作为上下文提供给模型。所以这套流程你可以看到reg其实是一个非常现代高效的上下文方案。","segment_identity_version":"v3.5-source-identity-v2","segment_ids":["segment_a0e612faad3578315d18d4c375f824b6b5a4448f0ba731add29bd34dd490c9b7","segment_976244ac6d767e5891c0d14285c45e92d395295484947c9f726528b7e52c2323","segment_cd5ac31e5b4ff355cbeceab4ccdaf474638c5f557fab107204c99d1edce9071b","segment_a1e4dc5d95691aa6bf2ec826aa223c9c0fd8a16b2a4bf295461924ea7e64467a","segment_fbea4d6518dba56bcb8e8b428916625dd48ccf5a8b4fd1072ef350b23f77fd3a","segment_0f813a8ee60b3fb6e973daf927c0a074b70c5b6176cc69883916615699dc0e09","segment_03b334eff4ce674a5064e689151cfc560fb9f0a9d45f4f42592748fab659901a"],"source_language":"und","source_quality_flag":"minor_asr_noise","source_type":"asr_transcript","source_version":"6767c30380e6d20b95790cf1aa4fef0db01ff6ec4d3aa10dfaf57fefeabcafd2","span_id":"PQS_V1_Q012_S_RAG","start_time":43.6,"timeline_run_id":"timeline_run_73a4ed7acd9f552b700d2d2e8c698678ab02a300561137ddb4340c709cfae910","translated_gloss":null,"video_id":"bilibili:BV18NLx6fEAq"},{"end_time":120.19,"quote_text":"但很奇怪，cloud code使用的却是非常朴素的，需要命令。还是刚刚那个问题，如果你在cloud code里面问，那么工作流程大概是先用l寻找各种可能的文件命名，然后再进一步用grab搜索文件内容。这个参索过程其实和人类工程师的做法是一样的，虽然看起来不太高效，但优点是在这个探索过程中，cloud也在了解项目，除了可以搞清楚一开始问的问题，还能顺带了解项目的架构、模块之间的依赖关系等等。","segment_identity_version":"v3.5-source-identity-v2","segment_ids":["segment_952960e0cd10e75b86f8942fa89ed00579e52f3913728254fef5ebe4a1671150","segment_0b933a2b104f9ee788f167563e73a3fdf7ca73fbf0e88fd34d890ea6be1be2ee","segment_a3d7e6b780d070594c71769ae6773d40d550d11a9d0176aca42f67391b9bb032"],"source_language":"und","source_quality_flag":"minor_asr_noise","source_type":"asr_transcript","source_version":"6767c30380e6d20b95790cf1aa4fef0db01ff6ec4d3aa10dfaf57fefeabcafd2","span_id":"PQS_V1_Q012_S_SHELL","start_time":89.85,"timeline_run_id":"timeline_run_73a4ed7acd9f552b700d2d2e8c698678ab02a300561137ddb4340c709cfae910","translated_gloss":null,"video_id":"bilibili:BV18NLx6fEAq"},{"end_time":179.82,"quote_text":"但代价就是这种做法对模型的要求比较高，无用的过程信息会记入上下文，对没那么聪明的模型来说是噪音会影响表现，更不用说这样的探索还会大量消耗token，不过这两点对于cloud来说都是可接受的，cloud模型本身足够聪明，不会被噪音影响。而token的消耗对于anthroic这种本身就是卖模型的公司来说又很喜闻乐见，所以既有好的模型又靠token赚钱，cloud code只使用share命令就非常水到渠成了，但curser是一个模型无关的产品，它的目标应该是所有模型都能有不错的表现。所以，与其让模型自由探索，不如做一个更可靠的，让各种模型都能表现的不错。所以两种方案都有代价，只是代价落在了不同的地方。Rank把复杂度放在了工程侧，而项命令把复杂度会放在模型侧。因此，你要选择哪个，取决于你更相信工程还是更相信模型。","segment_identity_version":"v3.5-source-identity-v2","segment_ids":["segment_4eaaa2dc51b4f0d434dcbcfb69dd9e502a589c9cebd1792b158cf2f9c8994e86","segment_81fbd164893dc3df63a41c42f439da8b1f2cc40d6c8bd415a88dde81bcc69174","segment_164cd5e0a799afd973365ce8ebd59894386ef6fa1b8bcabc8d442e0fc85b51bd","segment_7f0ad6016eb9292f1f57fd0acf55ee5fd015bcafd169174aa0770eefeb7e25f8","segment_bd8f42ea1840c81ca334808eda3992868dbb290103984c09a72869f5a239413a","segment_8758121c5e9672fbab9d82bc771053a68e66231d56f6c9e0c4ce6cb0f8a3f827"],"source_language":"und","source_quality_flag":"minor_asr_noise","source_type":"asr_transcript","source_version":"6767c30380e6d20b95790cf1aa4fef0db01ff6ec4d3aa10dfaf57fefeabcafd2","span_id":"PQS_V1_Q012_S_COST","start_time":120.82,"timeline_run_id":"timeline_run_73a4ed7acd9f552b700d2d2e8c698678ab02a300561137ddb4340c709cfae910","translated_gloss":null,"video_id":"bilibili:BV18NLx6fEAq"}]}
